# Evals first

Without measurement, AI work is vibe coding.

- Deterministic logic → **tests**.
- LLM/agent behavior → **evals** (dataset + grader + score).
- Prefer starting with 20–50 real failure-derived cases over a giant suite.
- Graders may be code, LLM-as-judge, or human; combine; spot-check traces.
- Change one variable per experiment (prompt, chunking, model, top_k).
- New models/prompts land only if evals improve (or cost/latency wins with no quality drop).
- Put datasets under `agent/evals/datasets/`; document rubric next to the suite.

If asked to add AI features without an eval path, create a minimal eval stub in the same change.
